口，卽今雲陽縣。杜佑曰：今雲陽縣治谷是。又曰：醴泉，漢谷口縣地，隋爲醴泉縣，谷口縣故城在縣西北。櫟，音藥。","note_content_jianti_auto":"班志，谷口、栎阳二县属左冯翊。师古曰：谷口，即今云阳县。杜佑曰：今云阳县治谷是。又曰：醴泉，汉谷口县地，隋为醴泉县，谷口县故城在县西北。栎，音药。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"905838c0-db0e-11ef-aab2-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"905838d3-db0e-11ef-8311-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：袤，音茂，長也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：袤，音茂，长也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"905838d2-db0e-11ef-9d72-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"中大夫","official_note":"中大夫是汉代官职，属于中央官员，负责顾问、议政等事务，此处赵中大夫白公提出修建水渠的建议，体现了其参与国家水利建设的职能。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"趙中大夫白公","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"b25fc9e2-9931-4f95-a477-515325f49af4"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"白公","people_name_jianti_auto":"白公","people_xingming":"白公","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"905838d4-db0e-11ef-b0b0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"趙","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵","place_note":"府邯郸，河北邯鄲","resolved_place_entity_id":88,"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"905838d5-db0e-11ef-8c4c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"涇水","place_name_jianti_auto":"泾水","resolved_place_entity_id":2691,"start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"905838d6-db0e-11ef-92b1-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"谷口","place_name_jianti_auto":"谷口","place_note":"陝西醴泉東北","resolved_place_entity_id":2519,"start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"905838d7-db0e-11ef-957e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"櫟陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"栎阳","place_note":"陝西臨潼","resolved_place_entity_id":1571,"start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"905838d8-db0e-11ef-985b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"渭中","place_name_jianti_auto":"渭中","resolved_place_entity_id":4916,"start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"905838d9-db0e-11ef-ac39-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"白渠","place_name_jianti_auto":"白渠","resolved_place_entity_id":3345,"start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"905838da-db0e-11ef-930f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/〇、封域山川险要（卷五十二）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"后汉迁雒，而郑、白两渠渐废。晋建兴四年，刘聪使刘曜寇长安...","context_before":"...年，左内史倪宽请穿六辅渠，以益溉郑国旁高卬[仰通]之田。","source_end_index":930,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"80846353-f857-5e6f-9de7-432c2a452538","source_start_index":766,"source_text":"太始二年，赵中大夫白公复奏穿渠引泾水。首起谷口，尾入栎阳[见临潼县]，注渭中，袤二百里，溉田四千五百余顷，因名曰白渠[颜师古曰：六辅渠，在郑渠上流之南。白渠，在郑渠下流之南]。民得其饶，歌之曰：田于何所？池阳谷口。郑国在前，白渠起后。举臿为云，决渠为雨。泾水一石，其泥数斗。且溉且粪，长我禾黍。衣食京师，亿万之口。言此两渠饶也。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/〇、封域山川险要（卷五十二）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"4趙中大夫白公奏穿渠引涇水，首起谷口，尾入櫟陽，注渭中，袤二百里，漑田四千五百餘頃，因名曰白渠；民得其饒。","content_fanyi":"赵国中大夫白公上奏朝廷，请求开凿水渠引泾水，渠首起于谷口，渠尾到栎阳，注入渭水之中，全长二百里，灌溉农田四千五百余顷，因此命名为白渠；当地百姓也因此得到富足。","content_jianti_auto":"4赵中大夫白公奏穿渠引泾水，首起谷口，尾入栎阳，注渭中，袤二百里，漑田四千五百余顷，因名曰白渠；民得其饶。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1792,"number":4,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"905838bf-db0e-11ef-a83d-a0d3651f611f"}],"reign_name":"二年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"二年","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"905838b7-db0e-11ef-8b4d-a0d3651f611f","year_anno":"（丙戌、前九五）","year_int":-95},"message":"success","success":true}